        <mxCell id="n2" value="&lt;b&gt;Stability at Sugihan-Lumpur&lt;/b&gt; (adjusted Rand index against the LiDAR run; 1 = identical, 0 = chance)&lt;br&gt;Primary outlets: noisy LiDAR copies 0.471 · other DTMs 0.48 · flat surface 0.348 · 24-30 units&lt;br&gt;Primary and secondary: 0.633 · 0.629 · 0.601 · 26-30 units&lt;br&gt;Primary and secondary, merged by flow line: 0.603 · 0.606 · 0.569 · 26-30 units" style="fontFamily=Source Sans 3;fontColor=#1F2A30;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;spacing=6;strokeWidth=1.25;fillColor=#F4F6F6;strokeColor=#B8C4C2;fontSize=14;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4;" vertex="1" parent="1">
